04-05T01:33:02Z","email":"barrientosd9@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Ramirez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T01:56:32Z","email":"barrientosd9@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Ramirez"},"message":"feat(design): premium redesign with micro-animations and skeleton loading\n\n- radius 0px → 6px + radius-lg 12px, propagates to all components\n- sidebar width 15% → 220px fixed, border-r separator\n- glow tokens: primary-glow and primary-glow-strong for hover effects\n- slide-enter duration 200ms → 300ms, translateY 0.75rem\n- new fade-up keyframe + animate-fade-up token\n- new shimmer keyframe + animate-shimmer token for skeleton loading\n- stagger-children utility: 6-child sequential fade-up (60ms increments)\n- SlideTransition: animate on first render (entering init true), h-full\n- CenterPanel: max-w-3xl + stagger-children wrapper on slot content\n- NavArrows: glow + scale(1.04) hover, scale(0.97) active, aria-hidden on SVGs\n- Sidebar: border-l-2 primary active accent, transition-all, dot transitions\n- Header: gradient accent line via-primary/30, border-b separator\n- BottomBar: pill dot (w-2→w-4 expand), glass border+shadow, mobile-only hint\n- PresentationLayout: ambient bg-gradient-to-br from-surface\n- PresentationSkeleton: full shimmer layout skeleton for MF remote Suspense\n- PresentationContainer: swap Suspense fallback to PresentationSkeleton\n- lefthook: remove redundant parallel format job (race condition on git add)","tree":{"sha":"cef41dc223d13eebd02aef57077cc392fb9cc4cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hyperxq/modular-frontend-architecture/git/trees/cef41dc223d13eebd02aef57077cc392fb9cc4cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hyperxq/modular-frontend-architecture/git/commits/c278ceccad420b989e44b7c88fb122a762cbb124","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22332354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user