s like Angular (#163)\n\nShared and exposed bundles decided ngDevMode, minification and advancedOptimizations\nfrom NF''s `dev` option, while Angular''s app build uses `optimization.scripts`. With the\ntwo out of sync, e.g. a production build with `optimization: false`, the app ran\nunminified against a production-mode, cached @angular/core.\n\nBoth bundlers now take their script options from one helper ported from\ngetEsBuildCommonOptions: ngDevMode, minifyIdentifiers/Syntax/Whitespace (with\nNG_BUILD_MANGLE / NG_BUILD_DEBUG_OPTIMIZE), conditions, mainFields, pure, sourcesContent\nand supported (incl. ''optional-catch-binding'' and native async/await when zoneless).\nlegalComments deliberately never becomes ''none'', since Angular''s license extraction\ndoesn''t see our bundles. The settings are part of the externals cache key, so changing\nthem rebuilds the shared bundles. `dev` keeps only its NF-specific meaning.","tree":{"sha":"d207e4eff2e07c7841f77741b1d2719b4f885153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/d207e4eff2e07c7841f77741b1d2719b4f885153"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/e146ffc02f71488e6c4e129159615af5bd942697","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","rep