ame":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(remote): replace deep @angular/build imports with own asset helpers\n\nThe remote builder failed to load with ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED: @angular/build''s exports map blocks src/utils/*. Port normalizeAssetPatterns and resolveAssets, with a spec that diffs them against Angular''s originals.\n\nGuard against regressions: check-entry-points.mjs (run in CI after build) imports every builder, schematic, generator and migration from dist/, and a lint rule bans @angular/*/src/* and @angular-devkit/*/src/* imports.\n\nCloses #153","tree":{"sha":"30984bc2d7c41a99dd034cd0ea07e9c01e993916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/30984bc2d7c41a99dd034cd0ea07e9c01e993916"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/22504f39a42fd4e37966108dec26b7d5648406fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-f