ts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:31:51Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:31:51Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"feat(schematics): remove \"files\" from tsconfig.federation.json in 22.2.0\n\nEach build context now supplies its own `files`, so the list the schematics used to seed only\ngoes stale and triggers a build warning. The 22.2.0 migration removes it from every project''s\ntsconfig.federation.json, editing in place so the file keeps its comments and formatting.\nOther tsconfigs are left alone.\n\nRefs #138","tree":{"sha":"65a3874ad95ef3e3de60218cb7e5f9ed82c15821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/65a3874ad95ef3e3de60218cb7e5f9ed82c15821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/188c1ec3d2c7bd363ab673a273e6349328ed1dd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/188c1ec3d2c7bd363ab673a273e6349328ed1dd5","node_id":"C_kwDOQxUdBtoAKDE4OGMxZWMzZDJjN2JkMzYzYWI2NzNhMjczZTYzNDkzMjhlZDFkZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121","sha":"a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121"}],"sha":"188c1ec3d2c7bd363ab673a273e6349328ed1dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/188c1ec3d2c7bd363ab673a273e6349328ed1dd5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:26:06Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:26:06Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: dispose every federation build context before the app build\n\nOnly ''mapping-or-exposed'' was disposed, but core now builds each mapping bundle as a context\nof its own, so their compiler plugins never reset Angular''s shared TS compilation state before\nthe app build (#47). A mappings-only host has no ''mapping-or-exposed'' at all: that dispose\nthrew and the catch hid it, leaving every context undisposed. A full dispose() is no option\neither, since it stops esbuild, which the app build still needs.\n\nThe adapter now offers disposeFederationContexts(), which disposes every mapping and exposed\ncontext and leaves esbuild running.\n\nRefs #138","tree":{"sha":"b6d92aa99d3d68421b2ea3379bca4496ff3bcb9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/b6d92aa99d3d68421b2ea3379bca4496ff3bcb9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121","node_id":"C_kwDOQxUdBtoAKGEwNTJiMGVjMTE4YzliNDBkYTYxNjE3NzYwNTAwOGUzZjVkZjQxMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/65a0dc310677e305150f5c8dbd7fb54ad14e0d37","sha":"65a0dc310677e305150f5c8dbd7fb54ad14e0d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/65a0dc310677e305150f5c8dbd7fb54ad14e0d37"}],"sha":"a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/a052b0ec118c9b40da616177605008e3f5df4121"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/65a0dc310677e305150f5c8dbd7fb54ad14e0d37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:23:25Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T10:23:25Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: give each federation build context its own tsconfig\n\nCore now builds shared mappings apart from exposed modules, one Angular context per mapping\nbundle plus mapping-or-exposed, all against the one federation tsconfig. Rewriting its `files`\nper context left the other contexts compiling without their entry points: Angular re-reads the\ntsconfig on every rebuild and serves a dropped file from the shared SourceFileCache, so a\nmapping edited in watch mode kept its old content without an error. A union of all entry\npoints would make every context compile everything instead.\n\nEach context now compiles against a generated tsconfig in the cache dir that extends the\nfederation tsconfig and lists only its own entry points. The federation tsconfig is no longer\nrewritten, the schematics stop seeding `files`, and a `files` key left in an existing one gets\na one-time warning. Default typeRoots are pinned to what the federation tsconfig resolves to,\nsince TypeScript derives them from the leaf config''s directory.\n\nRefs #138","tree":{"sha":"2b5d804d4e91b15d29b2402add196ccd0698896d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/2b5d804d4e91b15d29b2402add196ccd0698896d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/65a0dc310677e305150f5c8dbd7fb54ad14e0d37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":1102