Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/4b8fed04d262b1426c09987c780d9d28a7576493/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:06:52Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T08:06:52Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"refactor(utils): name the workspace-root correction after core''s\n\nCore landed the same rule as `toDiskCase` in `utils/disk-case.ts`; this side\ncalled it `toCanonicalCase` in `utils/canonical-workspace-root.ts`. Same guard,\nsame `realpathSync.native` reasoning, two names to reconcile whenever the two\nimplementations are read against each other.\n\nAlso adopts core''s `real === p` early return, so an already-correct root is\nhanded back untouched rather than through `path.normalize`. Behaviour is\nunchanged -- every consumer joins onto the root -- but the two functions now\nread line for line.\n\nRefs native-federation/angular-adapter#117","tree":{"sha":"0594e12d5e0e2dd5762df81dd77a95055b2e1be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/0594e12d5e0e2dd5762df81dd77a95055b2e1be3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/4b8fed04d262b1426c09987c780d9d28a7576493","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gis