lready exist. The file name now\nmatches its export and contrasts with the schematic''s generate- step.","tree":{"sha":"b141e07e084c186590911c752a3d297b702e733c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/trees/b141e07e084c186590911c752a3d297b702e733c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/git/commits/ee2269d2e202bc597ab521498f42971f1ab38ad0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/ee2269d2e202bc597ab521498f42971f1ab38ad0","node_id":"C_kwDOQxUdBtoAKGVlMjI2OWQyZTIwMmJjNTk3YWI1MjE0OThmNDI5NzFmMWFiMzhhZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/angular-adapter/commit/c2937ed7f7f2ad69f61eda838252f9434998fb0f","sha":"c2937ed7f7f2ad69f61eda838252f9434998fb0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/c2937ed7f7f2ad69f61eda838252f9434998fb0f"}],"sha":"ee2269d2e202bc597ab521498f42971f1ab38ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/ee2269d2e202bc597ab521498f42971f1ab38ad0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/angular-adapter/commits/c2937ed7f7f2ad69f61eda838252f9434998fb0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T06:35:21Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T06:35:21Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(bundler): fail with the path when the managed tsconfig is missing\n\nA tsconfig the NF target declares is read to have its files replaced, so an\nabsent one surfaced as a bare ENOENT from inside the bundler, naming a path\nwith no context. Throw before the read instead.\n\nThe check sits after the nothing-to-compile return, so a build with no entry\npoints of its own stays a no-op rather than failing on a file it never needed.","tree":{"sha":"5ad8d973395357ceaf2373deb30f99a14b852bbd","