:"anuragkr29@gmail.com","name":"Anurag Kumar"},"message":"feat(docker): add production-ready Docker and Nginx configuration\n\n- Create multi-stage Dockerfile for optimized builds\n- Configure Nginx for serving both host and remote assets\n- Implement security measures blocking direct HTML access to remote\n- Set up SPA fallback routing for React Router support\n- Add proper MIME types for ES modules (.mjs files)\n- Configure caching strategy (no-cache for HTML, immutable for assets)\n- Enable gzip compression for performance\n\nNginx routing strategy:\n- / → Host SPA with try_files fallback\n- /mf/* → Remote Module Federation assets only\n- *.html in /mf/ returns 404 for security\n\nThis enables single-container deployment while maintaining\nclear boundaries between host and remote applications.","tree":{"sha":"fd45cd168507077bea9252744b89db6680124c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anuragkr29/vite-module-federation-monorepo/git/trees/fd45cd168507077bea9252744b89db6680124c7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anuragkr29/vite-module-federation-monorepo/git/commits/4b8e07fa0fbe8189c4f6565e94c7ea103d4425c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35159874?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anuragkr29","id":35159874,"login":"anuragkr29","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTU5ODc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragkr29/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com