pi.github.com/users/PureMunky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PureMunky","id":459506,"login":"PureMunky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTUwNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PureMunky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PureMunky/todo-widget/commits/cbfe3476426e17614b956a7cce2cf55121cb51b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-31T15:38:44Z","email":"corbett.phil@gmail.com","name":"Phil Corbett"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-31T15:38:44Z","email":"corbett.phil@gmail.com","name":"Phil Corbett"},"message":"Add multi-view system with planning workflow\n\nImplement four distinct views for task management:\n- Planning view: Inbox sorted by due date with quick actions\n- Today view: Focused list of today''s tasks with descriptions\n- Board view: Original drag-and-drop kanban board\n- Calendar view: Tasks grouped by due date\n\nKey features:\n- Rename \"Upcoming\" to \"Backlog\" for clearer workflow (Inbox → Backlog → Today → Done)\n- Quick action buttons to move tasks to Backlog or Today\n- Inline date picker for quick due date changes\n- Snooze buttons (Tomorrow, Next Week) for easy rescheduling\n- View switcher tabs with persistent selection in localStorage\n- Responsive design for all views\n\nThis enables a GTD-style planning workflow where users process their\ninbox, organize tasks in backlog, and focus on today''s work.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78ff8c373743711b2441fdf597b74d