l@marutitech.com","name":"HardikSingh-Jamnal"},"message":"Integrate frontend with backend APIs for full-stack functionality\n\nFrontend Integration:\n- Created comprehensive API service layer (lib/api.ts)\n- Added TypeScript interfaces for all entities and requests\n- Implemented error handling and API communication utilities\n\nHome Page Updates:\n- Added client-side product listing with data from backend\n- Improved navigation with styled buttons\n- Added loading states and error handling\n\nProducts Management:\n- Full CRUD operations for products\n- Product creation, editing, and deletion forms\n- Real-time updates and validation\n- Grid layout with product cards\n\nOrder Management:\n- Interactive order creation interface\n- Product selection with quantity controls\n- Customer information forms\n- Order summary with total calculations\n- Recent orders display\n- Integration with products API for available items\n\nBilling Management:\n- Billing record creation from existing orders\n- Status management with dropdown updates\n- Automatic tax calculations\n- Payment method selection\n- Comprehensive billing record display\n- Transaction ID generation for paid status\n\nUI/UX Improvements:\n- Enhanced global CSS with better styling\n- Form validation and user feedback\n- Loading states and error messages\n- Responsive grid layouts\n- Hover effects and transitions\n- Success/error notifications\n\nEnvironment Configuration:\n- Added environment variables for API endpoints\n- Configurable backend service URLs\n- Development-ready configuration","tree":{"sha":"f3bfba62bb059a51d7e836a702539875f903df36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HardikSingh-Jamnal/AI-Code-Challenge/git/trees/f3bfba62bb059a51d7e836a702539875f903df36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HardikSingh-Jamnal/AI-Code-Challenge/git/commits/0c45c02bb937253c7e46f55b070ab623ff2f631d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"