},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/richard483/rein-dashboard/commits/af72676b74b53fbefef0af8455a9970cace8a531/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-01T17:49:09Z","email":"richard.william483@gmail.com","name":"richard483"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-01T17:49:09Z","email":"richard.william483@gmail.com","name":"richard483"},"message":"feat: Implement RBAC management system with user, role, and permission management features\n\n- Added protected routes for managing permissions, roles, and users.\n- Implemented layout and authentication checks for protected routes.\n- Created components for role and permission management, including creation, deletion, and assignment.\n- Developed user management features, including user creation, editing, and role assignment.\n- Integrated toast notifications for user feedback on actions.\n- Established a login page with authentication handling and redirection.\n- Added a global layout with a favicon and global styles.\n- Implemented a dashboard with statistics for users, roles, and permissions for super admins.\n- Included error handling and loading states for improved user experience.\n- Configured TypeScript, Vite, and Tailwind CSS for project setup.","tree":{"sha":"da56c67ffea67cbfe8f2178055f5bd4b2dd986c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/richard483/rein-dashboard/git/trees/da56c67ffea67cbfe8f2178055f5bd4b2dd986c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/richard483/rein-dashboard/git/commits/af72676b74b53fbefef0af8455a9970cace8a531","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70947923?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard483/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard483/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard483/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richard483/gists{/gi